OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to come followed by
OL,7,Fmostly clear and dry night, with
OL,8,Fperhaps an isolated shower in northern
OL,9,Fparts. Feeling cool for many, with
OL,10,Fsome very light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,13,FFriday morning, with some patchy cloud
OL,14,Fin the north. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,15,Finto the afternoon, but feeling warm
OL,16,Fin the sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
